    {
      "bbox": [
        154,
        1558,
        1473,
        1831
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(ii) review existing mechanisms and efforts to combat graffiti in the City, assist public and private organizations in their efforts to control graffiti and advise the Mayor on issues relating to the effective coordination of such efforts among various entities. Such review shall include an assessment of current legislation related to graffiti control, the enforcement of existing laws, and the status of public and private efforts to remove existing graffiti;",
