        1854,
        1464,
        2040
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(iii) review and assess efforts of volunteer groups to discourage and remove graffiti, provide such guidance to voluntary groups as may be helpful, devise mechanisms to assist volunteer groups and recommend to the Mayor ways in which the efforts of these groups can be further encouraged, assisted and expanded;",
